# ==========================================
# POST-PRODUCTION PLANNING - ENVIRONMENT SETUP
# ==========================================
# 
# This file explains how to set up API keys for the Post-Production Planning app.
# The app uses Google Sheets as the data source (YAML loading has been removed).
#
# ==========================================
# STEP 1: GET A GOOGLE API KEY
# ==========================================
#
# Option A: Get a Gemini API Key (recommended - works for both Gemini AI and Sheets)
#   1. Go to: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#   2. Click "Create API Key"
#   3. Copy the key
#
# Option B: Create in Google Cloud Console
#   1. Go to: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials?project=gen-lang-client-0369583419
#   2. Click "Create Credentials" → "API Key"
#   3. Copy the key
#
# ==========================================
# STEP 2: ENABLE GOOGLE SHEETS API
# ==========================================
#
# Your API key must have Google Sheets API enabled:
#   1. Go to: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/sheets.googleapis.com?project=gen-lang-client-0369583419
#   2. Click "ENABLE" button
#   3. Wait a few seconds for it to activate
#
# ==========================================
# STEP 3: MAKE YOUR SPREADSHEET ACCESSIBLE
# ==========================================
#
# The spreadsheet must be shared publicly (view-only is fine):
#   1. Open your Google Sheet
#   2. Click "Share" button (top right)
#   3. Under "General access", change to "Anyone with the link"
#   4. Set permission to "Viewer"
#   5. Click "Done"
#
# Current Spreadsheet:
# https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19Oof1uMH-fh5Lt8_thltIoUOCufWbY0tY-gM88GEO30
#
# ==========================================
# STEP 4: ADD YOUR API KEY TO THE APP
# ==========================================
#
# In the app (post_prod_artifact_plan.html):
#   1. Click "⚙️ Actions" in the top menu
#   2. Click "🔑 Manage API Keys"
#   3. Paste your Google API Key
#   4. Click "Test Key" to verify it works
#
# The key is stored securely in your browser's cookies/localStorage.
# It is NOT sent to any server except Google's APIs.
#
# ==========================================
# SPREADSHEET STRUCTURE
# ==========================================
#
# Your Google Sheet should have these sheets (tabs):
#   1. Overview      - Project title in cell B3, metadata in A1:B10
#   2. Scenes Summary - Scene overview data
#   3. All Lines     - Main data with all scene lines and prompts
#   4. Uploaded Assets - Asset tracking
#
# Required columns in "All Lines" sheet (row 1 = headers):
#   - scene_id or sceneid
#   - scenetitle or scene_title
#   - line_id or id
#   - time
#   - script or line or text
#   - image_prompt, graphic_prompt, music_prompt, animation_prompt
#   - motion_graphics_prompt, sound_effect_prompt, diagram_prompt, html_prompt
#   - (optional) *_output columns for generated content URLs
#   - (optional) verified_* columns for verification status
#
# ==========================================
# TROUBLESHOOTING
# ==========================================
#
# Error: "Failed to load from Google Sheets"
#   → Check that Sheets API is enabled (Step 2)
#   → Check that spreadsheet is shared publicly (Step 3)
#   → Test your API key in 🔑 Manage API Keys
#
# Error: "API key not valid"
#   → Create a new API key (Step 1)
#   → Make sure you're using the correct Google Cloud project
#
# Error: "Sheet not found" or "Unable to parse range"
#   → Check that your sheet names match: Overview, All Lines
#   → Update GOOGLE_SHEETS_CONFIG.sheetName in script.js if different
#
# ==========================================
# EXAMPLE ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (for reference)
# ==========================================
# 
# Note: This app runs entirely in the browser and doesn't use a .env file directly.
# These are just for documentation purposes.

GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
GOOGLE_SPREADSHEET_ID=19Oof1uMH-fh5Lt8_thltIoUOCufWbY0tY-gM88GEO30
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your_elevenlabs_key_here

# ==========================================
# USEFUL LINKS
# ==========================================
